@startuml ppo_architecture_enhanced
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

package "PPO Training Architecture" {
  component [**Cyberwheel Environment**\nNetwork State $S_t$\nAttack/Defense Actions\nReward Generation $R_t^{(b)}$] as Environment #E6FFE6

  component [**Blue Agent (PPO)**\nPolicy Network $\pi_\theta$\nValue Network $V_\phi$\nPPO Optimization] as BlueAgent #E6F3FF

  component [**Red Agent (Fixed)**\nMITRE ATT&CK Policy\nConsistent Adversary] as RedAgent #FFE6E6
}

BlueAgent --> Environment : $a_t^{(b)} \in \mathcal{A}^{(b)}$
Environment --> BlueAgent : $s_t^{(b)} \in \mathcal{S}^{(b)}, r_t^{(b)} \in \mathbb{R}$
RedAgent --> Environment : $a_t^{(r)} \in \mathcal{A}^{(r)}$
Environment --> RedAgent : $s_t^{(r)} \in \mathcal{S}^{(r)}$

BlueAgent --> BlueAgent : Policy Update\nPPO Objective

note bottom of BlueAgent : $J^{(b)}(\pi^{(b)}) = \mathbb{E}_{\pi}[\sum_{t=0}^{\infty} \gamma^t R_t^{(b)}]$\n$\mathcal{L}^{CLIP}(\theta) = \mathbb{E}[ \min(r_t(\theta)\hat{A}_t, \mathrm{clip}(r_t(\theta), 1-\epsilon, 1+\epsilon)\hat{A}_t) ]$\n$\epsilon = 0.2, \gamma = 0.99, \lambda = 0.95$

@enduml
